cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the paper given under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "chla-hybrid-forecast: code, data and results for a hybrid chlorophyll-a forecast with hard constraints"
abstract: >-
  Code, daily monitoring data and summary tables for the paper "Hard constraints make an accurate hybrid chlorophyll-a
  forecast interpretable: a process equation with an xLSTM correction". Included scripts rebuild every generated table
  and figure of the paper, recompute the result tables from saved forecasts and model files, and retrain all models from
  scratch.
